OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over new school streets
OL,4,Atraffic ban trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about traffic
OL,7,Fand safety a month into a trial
OL,8,Frestricting vehicles on roads around
OL,9,Ftwo schools at pick-up and drop-off
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,12,FOxfordshire County Council's school
OL,13,Fstreets scheme started in Carterton in
OL,14,Fearly September, and applies to Edith
OL,15,FMoorhouse and St Joseph's Primary for
OL,16,Ftwo hours a day.
OL,18,FBut parents, residents and the town
OL,19,Fcouncil said the restrictions were
OL,20,Fhaving a knock-on effect on parking,
OL,21,Fwith some warning it had created new
OL,22,Fsafety concerns.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
